#[[###]]# Aggregate

The code below:

<!-- MACRO{snippet|id=hasAggregate|file=${project.basedir}/src/test/java/it/tidalwave/ui/test/ExamplesTest.java} -->

ensures that `pm3` has got an `Aggregate` role of `PresentationModel`s associated to names `firstName`, `lastName` and `birthDate`, with three items whose
